      "nets": ["TTL"],
      "observed": "The MAX3485's differential outputs A (pin 6) and B (pin 7) both carry the same net label 'TTL', placing them on one net and shorting the differential pair together.",
      "expected": "A and B are the differential pair of the RS-485 transceiver; for the single-wire servo bus only one of them should drive the bus, and the two must not be shorted.",
